{"3275750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Drop", "steam_appid": 3275750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Inspired by life</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a strong story that takes inspiration from real life.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.poster.avif?t=1787059394\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.webm?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.mp4?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO NYKYLÄ, FINLAND. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE YEAR IS 1994.</strong> Step into the boots of Seppo &quot;Zeze&quot; Sahtivaara in a gritty, story-driven action-adventure. <i>Last Drop</i> combines the nostalgic freedom of an open-world sandbox with intense 1v1 combat and a cinematic narrative inspired by real events and authentic Finnish locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School 1v1 Brawling:</strong> Settle your disputes the old-fashioned way. Master a deep, fighting-game-style combat system to crush your rivals. No guns, just pure skill and heavy hits. Learn new moves by watching VHS action movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/a7b2eb1d1a0731e194e7926d9cde632c.poster.avif?t=1787059394\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/a7b2eb1d1a0731e194e7926d9cde632c.webm?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/a7b2eb1d1a0731e194e7926d9cde632c.mp4?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Open-World Sandbox:</strong> Explore the weird and wonderful streets of Nykylä and surrounding towns. Buy and drive retro cars, ride bikes, find work to earn cash, or just hit the local pub for a drink. You make the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/be361b6a6ae2cd3d9a8e645ec95ef509.poster.avif?t=1787059394\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/be361b6a6ae2cd3d9a8e645ec95ef509.webm?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/be361b6a6ae2cd3d9a8e645ec95ef509.mp4?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Progression:</strong> Level up Zeze to survive the underworld. Upgrade your stats including HP, Strenght, Agility, Stamina, and manage your inventory, wallet, and even your <i>Drunkenness</i> level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling:</strong> Experience a crazy, impactful narrative brought to life with movie-style cutscenes. The golden era of action movies meets interactive drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing World:</strong> Immerse yourself in a dynamic environment with a full day/night cycle and changing weather. Watch the town react as shops open and close based on the in-game clock. Grab a cold beer, heat up the sauna, and prepare for the ultimate 90s nostalgia trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/8cb1c13d332c4c16d1480e794369dfc1.poster.avif?t=1787059394\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/8cb1c13d332c4c16d1480e794369dfc1.webm?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/8cb1c13d332c4c16d1480e794369dfc1.mp4?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.poster.avif?t=1787059394\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.webm?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275750/extras/d92bd50305231a2d3526a09506d6f31e.mp4?t=1787059394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO NYKYLÄ, FINLAND. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE YEAR IS 1994.</strong> Step into the